### Search region by UUID (triggers pipeline if no summaries exist)
# Replace with actual region UUID from region_mapping table
POST http://localhost:8080/orch/api/regions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/search

### Search region (localhost) - Example UUID
# POST http://localhost:8081/orch/api/regions/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/search

### Expected responses:
# 1. If summaries exist:
# {
#   "status": "Done",
#   "summaries": [
#     {
#       "summary": "...",
#       "created_at": "2026-02-15T10:30:00Z"
#     }
#   ]
# }
#
# 2. If batch is being processed:
# {
#   "status": "Processing", // or "FetchQueued", "Fetching", "LlmQueued"
#   "summaries": []
# }
#
# 3. If no batch exists (will create one):
# {
#   "status": "FetchQueued",
#   "summaries": []
# }
